  "problem_statement": "Test Case: Gajab Demo Customer Journey (Stable Showcase)\n\nWebsite: https://stg.gajab.com/\nTest Credentials:\n- Mobile Number: random 10 digit number\n- OTP: '123456'\n- Name: Test User\n- Gender: Male\n- Pin Code: '560001'\n- Product Brand: SERA'S BASKET\n- Price Range: 427 to 727\n- Payment Method: Net Banking\n\nSteps:\n1. Launch browser\n2. Navigate to url 'https://stg.gajab.com/'\n3. Verify that home page is visible\n4. Click on 'Log in' or 'Sign up' button\n5. Verify url contains 'signin' after page loads\n6. Enter random 10 digit mobile number in mobile field\n7. Click on the check box for terms and conditions\n8. Click 'Request OTP' button\n9. Enter OTP '123456' in OTP field\n10. Wait for account creation form page to appear\n11. Enter name 'Test User' in name field\n12. Click on 'Male' button for gender selection\n13. Click on 'Submit' or 'Next' button to create account\n14. Click on location dropdown or location search field\n15. Wait for location search field to become active\n16. Enter pin code '560001' in location search field\n17. Verify location results are displayed\n18. Select the location from search results or dropdown\n19. Verify that Gajab Deal of the Day section is visible\n20. Capture the product name from Deal of the Day\n21. Capture the product image from Deal of the Day\n22. Capture the asking price from Deal of the Day\n23. Navigate to Trending Products section\n24. Identify the most-bargained product under Trending Products\n25. Capture screenshot of the most-bargained product\n26. Verify that Just Bargained section is visible on home page\n27. Capture the name and city of the latest live order\n28. Click on Toys and Games category tab\n29. Click on SERA'S BASKET brand from the left filter\n30. Click on price range filter and set from 427 to 727\n31. Click on the selected product\n32. Click on Bargain button to start bargaining\n33. Enter bargain offer and submit\n34. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n35. Enter another bargain offer and submit\n36. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n37. Enter final bargain offer and submit\n38. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n39. Click on Accept button to accept the final bargain offer\n40. Click on Buy Now button\n41. Enter address line 1 '123 Demo Street' in address line 1 field\n42. Enter address line 2 'Near Demo Landmark' in address line 2 field\n43. Select Home address type button\n44. Click on Save Address button\n45. Click on Pay Online payment option\n46. Click on Pay button\n47. Click on Net Banking option\n48. Click on a bank from the list\n49. Complete payment on bank portal",
